# Keeps public/ present in a fresh clone.
#
# Git does not track empty directories, and the Dockerfile runner stage does
# COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public, which fails outright when the
# directory is absent. Without this file the first CI publish job would break
# on a clean checkout even though local builds succeeded, because local builds
# had a public/ left over from development.
#
# Delete this once there is a real asset in here.
